# Raw Sentinel-2 stacks: 77 MB, regenerable from basc_fetch.py with CDSE
# credentials. The derived series/ and chips/ are committed instead.
basc/results/l2a/
basc/results/aoi400/
*.tif
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Copies of a live Cloud Run production model — deliberately not committed.
# Originals: ~/Aterio/aterio-gcp-data-operations/gcp-cloud-run/services/
#   data-centers/data-process-data-centers-api/app/models/
*.pkl

# Symlinks to Aterio label/cache data in acd-polygon-lab. Deliberately not
